  "post_content": "<p>El Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda ha conmemorado el quinto centenario del nacimiento de Santa Teresa, con la proyecci&oacute;n de una pel&iacute;cula y una conferencia a cargo de M. Victoria Aymerich Mart&iacute;nez, Hermana de la Consolaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/03/IMG_2215.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El jueves 12 de marzo se ha proyectado la pel&iacute;cula Teresa, Teresa, una entrevista virtual con la santa, dirigida por Rafael Gordon e interpretada por Assumpta Serna (entrevistadora) e Isabel ordaz en el papel de la Santa.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/03/P3137652.jpg\" style=\"height: 360px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En la conferencia&nbsp;del viernes 13, la Hermana Victoria Aymerich Mart&iacute;nez ha repasado &#39;La poes&iacute;a popular y m&iacute;stica de Santa Teresa de Jes&uacute;s&#39;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2208.jpg\" alt=\"img_2208\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2210.jpg\" alt=\"img_2210\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2211.jpg\" alt=\"img_2211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2214.jpg\" alt=\"img_2214\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2215.jpg\" alt=\"img_2215\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2218.jpg\" alt=\"img_2218\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/img_2220.jpg\" alt=\"img_2220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/p3137649.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/p3137650.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesateneu5centenarisantateresa/p3137652.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
